title: "anima-substrate"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-08
authors:
  - alias: Anshul48
    email: anshulraj48@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  A small, offline, stdlib-only Python host for persistent project
  worlds: nested delegation, pinned participant families, crash-atomic
  local state, fusion/fission/quarantine, portable composites, and an
  evidence-grounded propose-assess-retain-reuse loop. Single-host, toy
  scale, process-crash-only envelope; no learning or discovery claims.
keywords:
  - nested-worlds
  - accountable-recovery
  - composite-reuse
  - offline
